# Artifact build output: dist/foldspacer.html is a fragment with no <html> wrapper and is
# only meaningful inside the publishing host. docs/index.html is the page that ships.

# Only the structures the build actually reads are tracked. The rest are candidates that
# were tried and left out of the campaign (see tools/make_folds.js), and they are 22 MB.
